=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Etteh Sulaej} J-9. You will receive the {@k} {k:Letter to Angelica}.
* Take the letter to {z:Windurst Waters}, and talk to {n:Angelica} at the Rarab Tail Hostelry. Then you will receive {@k} {k:Angelica's letter} and a painting {@k} {k:"Final Fantasy"} that she wants you to hang in {z:Temple of Uggalepih}.
* Go back to {z:Kazham}, talk to {n:Etteh Sulaej}.
* Go to (G-8) on the first map for the {z:Temple of Uggalepih}, and hang the picture at Stone Picture Frame (it is on the south wall of the Paintbrush Room) to spawn the {p:Golem|Category:Golem} NM, {m:Trompe L'Oeil} .
** Temple of Uggalepih {p:Survival Guide} warp puts you a short distance from the Stone Frame.
* Defeat the NM, then check the frame and you will obtain a {@k} {k:Ripped "Final Fantasy" painting}.
** If in a party, there is a 10 minute wait between being able to respawn the NM.
* Return to {n:Etteh Sulaej}. As a reward, you will receive 3000 Gil.

=3 Repeating the Quest
You can repeat the quest. The only difference is when you speak to {n:Angelica}, you will instead receive the {k:"Final Fantasy Part II"} key item rather than the original. The rest of the steps are the same.
